  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Transformation for Business Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WomenWork will connect 500 women on a digital platform and link them to data that will improve their decision making ability and connect them with on-line customers using a digital platform. WomenWork currently aspires to support women led businesses to digitize their operations, make data-driven decisions, and acquire customers online through digital platforms, especially in light of the current COVID-19 pandemic that has changed the way businesses are managed. Moreover, digitizing operations may alleviate unnecessary exposure to COVID-19 during the pandemic.</narrative>
  </description>
